  m_Name: Weaver
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 2
  moveSpeed: 1.9
  scoreValue: 150
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A Descender that learned doubt. It swings across the sky as it falls,
    never quite committing to a lane, scattering short arcs of shot as if sowing
    a field.
  tactics: Weaves side to side while dropping and lobs a small green arc downward.
    Its position is predictable - a smooth sine - so lead it slightly when you shoot.
    The arc punishes you for standing still; keep drifting and it never touches you.
